			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> we ARE still using jQuery for everything. It’s on 75% of websites. JQuery is just like WordPress: everybody uses it, except people with loud voices who think they define what the web is.</p>",
