			},
			"date": "2023-04-18T22:04:57.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> obviously I myself love all the things that you build :) but most of the world and most of the web aren’t that enlightened. Jquery is really popular, except among people who don’t want it to be :)</p>",
