			"date": "2023-04-18T22:27:02.998Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@sil\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>sil</span></a></span> of course this thread was not an indictment of jQuery, of which I was and am still a fan 🥰</p>",
